{"id":"34345","texts":[{"kind":"transcription","label":"תעתיק","editor":"umrethwala","citation":"Yusuf Umrethwala, PGP Transcriptions‎ (in Arabic) (n.p., 2023).","html":"<section dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\"> <div data-canvas=\"https://cudl.lib.cam.ac.uk/iiif/MS-TS-00010-J-00009-00027/canvas/2\"> <ol>\n<li><span lang=\"ar\">ولا يخرج عن احكامها واما امسا[ك</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"ar\">ما يتم من التدبير من وقع الا[</span></li>\n</ol> </div> </section>"}]}